{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜小一入學自行分配學位結果公布／愛達花城號停靠啟德郵輪碼頭\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261123.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】全港官立及資助小學今日(11月23日)公布明年九月入讀小一的學校自行分配學位錄取名單。另外，國產郵輪愛達花城號在南沙啟航後，今日停靠啟德郵輪碼頭。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:23:52.889705+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":81,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T23:43:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T00:57:27.782789+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T00:17:45.959795+00:00","content_hash":"e715c9d823314281f8714b0c3e0bed0383a3e02500ec8a8b6b228d370e5b1237","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}